["<aside class=\"callout why\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Ducks leave little sign on the land. Their best sign is in the air: where they fly at first and last light.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 338\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A duck pond with five numbered clues, tips. 1: droppings on logs and beaver dams. 2: feathers at the water edge. 3: muddy, stirred up water where ducks tipped up to feed. 4: open lanes swum through duckweed. 5: webbed tracks in the mud.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"338\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sign on a duck pond: five clues</text>\n<path d=\"M0 40 H400 V150 C330 160 270 140 200 150 C130 160 60 144 0 152z\" fill=\"#7fa6c6\"/>\n<path d=\"M0 152 C60 144 130 160 200 150 C270 140 330 160 400 150 V232 H0z\" fill=\"#c9b08a\"/>\n<path d=\"M0 152 C60 144 130 160 200 150 C270 140 330 160 400 150\" stroke=\"#8e7656\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/>\n<circle cx=\"381\" cy=\"77\" r=\"2.3\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"297\" cy=\"58\" r=\"2.3\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"174\" cy=\"66\" r=\"1.7\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"111\" r=\"3.0\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"50\" r=\"1.9\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"361\" cy=\"80\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"275\" cy=\"90\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"112\" r=\"3.0\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"342\" cy=\"72\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"247\" cy=\"109\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"60\" r=\"2.9\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"267\" cy=\"111\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"88\" r=\"2.7\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"233\" cy=\"110\" r=\"2.7\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"349\" cy=\"58\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#8db84a\"/><circle cx=\"333\" cy=\"55\"